    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412190/extras/1b40e37427ba19e2ba1dd97336ccdf9d.poster.avif?t=1738578122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412190/extras/1b40e37427ba19e2ba1dd97336ccdf9d.webm?t=1738578122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412190/extras/1b40e37427ba19e2ba1dd97336ccdf9d.mp4?t=1738578122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take a breath. Think. Manipulate the blocks. Build your perfect own loop. Enjoy your victory, it's satisfying to look at. &quot;Meaningless&quot; (originally &quot;An Oddly Satisfying Game&quot;) is a hypnotizing puzzle game for PC imagined during the Ludum Dare 49.<br><br>Inspired by Monument Valley art, it\u2019s a minimalist 3D isometric game.<br>To make it simple: one level, one puzzle, one frame.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412190/extras/7f62b3aad738a64570c36f15453acec5.poster.avif?t=1738578122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412190/extras/7f62b3aad738a64570c36f15453acec5.webm?t=1738578122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412190/extras/7f62b3aad738a64570c36f15453acec5.mp4?t=1738578122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A level is divided into two parts.<br>The first one: move the blocks to let the ball reach the finishing line. When the ball is rolling, all interactions with blocks are recorded.<br>The second one: if the ball reaches the finishing line, the entire recorded loop is replayed endlessly. Enjoy what you made and play with the recorded loop like a VHS.<br><br>The experience is inspired by the satisfying videos on YouTube or TikTok.<br>It\u2019s the pleasure to watch a smooth and repetitive process without any flaws.<br>It seems easy, it\u2019s hypnotizing and satisfying.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412190/extras/2ba82aeac47b2d1a743488d5fcfd4754.avif?t=1738578122\" /></span><br><br><br>Are you a streamer? Do want to play with your community and share exclusive and unique moment with them?<br>It's now possible! One clic and your Twitch account is connected to the game. Then viewers interact in game from the chat.<br>Very fun and easy to setup: Try it now!",
